## To native args () -> Seq of Text
## To native parseInt (s: Text) -> Int

## Main
Let arguments be args().
Let n be word64(parseInt(item 2 of arguments)).
Let a be word64(0).
Let b be word64(1).
Let i be word64(0).
While i is less than n:
    Let temp be b.
    Set b to (a + b) % word64(1000000007).
    Set a to temp.
    Set i to i + word64(1).
Show a.
